  "rcc_retention": "Inspect SOURCE after keyed APBEN2 gate enable and before oscillator modifications; HSIOSC-selected RTC requires enabled stable factory trim, else return RtcClockInUse. Other sources remain configured but cannot attach to this source-qualified API.",
